WEBVTT

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:44.670
Thanks for laying your hands on my kids.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.210
I'm here to repay the favor.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:56.070
Have you come to take me down yourself,

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.220
Jin Toujou?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:28.870
Whoa!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.900
I guess I've lost my edge after all.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.250
Bummer...

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:45.510
Still, I thought you were the kind of scum that sat back and schemed.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:51.520
I didn't expect you to be such a brave young man.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:52.710
Silence.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:58.730
Most of all, you have good eyes.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:04.280
Looks like the rot lies elsewhere, huh?

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.520
<i>So this is Jin Toujou?</i>

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:14.060
<i>His renown as a war god isn't just idle talk.</i>

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.300
However!

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.810
Oh? As expected of a Demon Lord's weapon.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.070
Devour him, Loki!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:50.560
Wha—?!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.520
Leohart-sama!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.820
Are you safe?!

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.780
You fiend!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.590
Stand back!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.320
None of you would be a match for him!

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.130
Jin Toujou...

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.870
Onii-chan!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.380
No way, I'm...

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.170
Huh?

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.350
Morning breakfast with a perverted woman...

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:20.910
How invigorating.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.950
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.150
Here! Sorry for the wait.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:27.670
<i>Eh?</i>

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.160
Hey, what's this?!

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:32.420
A soft-shelled turtle stew, 
stewed in soft-shelled turtle drink.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:36.410
Since you have a sports festival, 
you need to build up your vitality.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.370
Hey, hey, how did it come to that?!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.300
Ahh, I want to see it in person, too.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.370
Rather, I want you to let me in.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.040
This house arrest has made me restless.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.590
Ahh, a sports festival!

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.800
What exactly do you think it is?!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.780
I'm surprised, though.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:57.180
About what?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:01.420
I didn't expect you to be the type who'd join the executive committee.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.120
Yet you volunteered.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:05.710
That's true. Why did you?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:12.700
I thought it might be nice to try leading a normal school life.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.780
Excuse me.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.170
Toujou?

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.100
What's wrong?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.850
Your face is red.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.480
N-No, it's nothing.

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.490
Umm, Hasegawa-sensei?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:54.640
Oh, Tachibana. How have you been feeling lately?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:58.630
R-Right. Lately I've been doing very well.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.300
It's thanks to you!

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.750
I see. That's good.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.750
Okay then, good luck to both of you preparing for the sports festival.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.580
<i>What was that just now?</i>

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.190
What's wrong, Toujou-kun?

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.270
Oh, nothing.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:32.590
You know, I actually became a member of the committee

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.410
because Hasegawa-sensei recommended it to me.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:40.870
She said those with weaker bodies should enjoy the sports festival that way.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:44.160
Wow, that's a nice way of thinking about it.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:48.290
So I really want to make it a success.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.470
I see.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.420
Let's do our best, Tachibana.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:54.030
Yeah.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.680
You, shut up!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:08:01.770
Quit complaining so much over adding a firework or two!

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:03.640
The budget is limited.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.270
You can't just order extra on your own!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.770
If you're on the committee, then figure something out!

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.770
No means no!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.360
I quit! I quit!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.820
Why don't we just run this whole sports festival into the ground?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.880
Then there wouldn't be any 
need to worry about a budget!

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:21.770
Right?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.830
Donoue-senpai!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:27.710
I told you to shut up!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:33.210
Could you stop there, Donoue-senpai?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.210
Y-You!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.970
You!

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.930
Hey, calm down, Donoue, Toujou.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:46.480
If you have an opinion, then talk it out.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:47.730
Shut up!

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.980
You're awfully noisy.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:51.690
Huh?

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.720
If you're dissatisfied with your school life,

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:07.110
then I'll listen.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.520
Come.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.360
Okay...

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.700
Do you have a moment, Toujou?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.260
Yes.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:32.600
I'm not trying to lecture you.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.350
I understand how you feel.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.650
But it wasn't right to lay your hand on him there.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:38.530
But—

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:42.230
Well, just leave Donoue's gang to me.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.150
All right.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.970
Also, Toujou...

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.290
Watch out for Hasegawa-sensei.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:48.540
Huh?

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:53.010
She's beautiful, intelligent, and a kind teacher.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:55.800
I can understand why you might space out around her,

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.530
but unfortunately, in this world,

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.580
being good and proper isn't enough to make you liked.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.310
That's why people always have someone who hates them.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.780
Yet Hasegawa-sensei doesn't.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.930
Everyone likes her.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.020
Everyone...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.690
It's as though she's using some kind of magic.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.720
Sakasaki-sensei.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.020
Hmm? What is it?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.450
I got a hold of the fireworks shop.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.960
When I explained the situation, they said they'd see us.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.840
Hey, you two.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.310
What do you want, Takigawa?

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:58.470
I thought you were returning to the demon realm.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:10:59.200
Yeah,

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:04.450
but before that, I wanted to give you all a warning.

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.520
A warning?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.660
About Basacchi.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:13.200
A while back I made Naruse's power go out of control during battle,

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.230
and Basacchi saved you.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:19.430
However, if Basacchi's power were forced to go out of control,

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.920
could you two save him?

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.420
That's—!

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.220
If you feel even a little responsibility,

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.270
then get stronger.

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:31.930
At least strong enough to kill him, should it ever come to that.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:34.600
Later.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.790
We need to talk.

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:58.960
I agree.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.970
I'm sorry, Toujou-kun.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.750
I didn't mean to keep you this late.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.690
It's okay.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.170
Sorry.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.480
Well then, take care on your way home.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:20.470
We will.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.860
In a moment, the special express will be passing through on track two.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.370
A barrier?!

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.350
What's this?!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.340
Are they being controlled?!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.630
Magic?!

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:52.390
No way!

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:54.640
The barrier?!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.300
<i>If I avoid them...</i>

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.760
<i>I'll have to deal with them all.</i>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.790
Come at me!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.580
<i>Even if I can't take them all—!</i>

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.260
Huh?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:25.100
I came to see what happened when this barrier suddenly went up.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.540
Kurumi?!

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.420
Wait! Those people are being controlled!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:38.060
I'm holding back.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.480
Don't take me for a fool!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:48.760
Now we just need to erase their
 memories of us, and we're done.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.050
I see.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:56.690
Because of the report Yuuki made to the village...

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.440
They thought Onee wasn't enough to handle observing things on her own,

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.270
so they dispatched an extra member.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:05.550
So that's why you're here.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:06.630
Thanks.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.940
I came for Onee's sake.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:11.510
Not for you or Naruse Mio!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.260
Yeah, I know.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:18.170
Still, Basara, don't you have any idea who might want to target you?

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:23.270
I felt some faint, unknown waves coming from your school, too.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.770
I see.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.530
We're home!    {I'm home!}

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.370
Mio? Maria?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.260
Onee!

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:58.200
Huh?

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:00.470
Mio?

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.300
Onee?

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:11.320
Surprise! It's a great success!

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.860
Maria, what's this?

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:17.120
Yes, pardon me for a moment.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.510
Now it's perfect!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.330
You two?!

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.400
Master...

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.590
Mas...

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.400
ter...

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.370
H-Hey, you two?

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.490
What's going on?! What is this?!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:51.710
No!

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.460
The Master-Servant pact?!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:03.140
In other words, all that just now was 
to deepen your Master-Servant bond

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.740
with Basara and raise your combat prowess?

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:06.980
Yes.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:12.160
Since Mio and I both became 
bitches and submitted to Basara,

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.230
all three of us have grown stronger.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.800
We talked it over together.

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.320
Training and practice isn't enough on its own.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:24.320
We agreed we need to do everything we can to grow stronger.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.130
So we decided to submit to Basara even more.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:30.120
We wanted to deepen our bond of trust.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.750
As such, Maria suggested this would be best.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.410
As a result, we both became bitches.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.670
That's crazy!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.500
No matter how much you wanted to be stronger,

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.340
relying on the magic of demons and doing things like—

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.230
It's crazy?

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:51.120
If Yuuki-san hadn't forged a 
Master-Servant pact with Basara-san,

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:56.100
then it's likely we all would've died during the fight against Zolgia.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.460
Would you have preferred that, Kurumi-san?

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.650
That's—

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.990
Stop that, Maria.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:06.610
Kurumi doesn't know about our circumstances.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.790
Oh, so that's the case.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.460
In other words, it was too stimulating for the little kid

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:19.600
who knows absolutely nothing about these things or the delicacies between men and women,

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:23.240
so she's just getting annoyingly angry with us to hide her own embarrassment?

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.300
D-Don't treat me like a kid!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:28.890
I'm an adult who matured earlier than Onee!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.000
My breasts have grown bigger, too,

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.640
and I'm a match for her size!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.000
You say you're more mature than Yuuki-san?

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.650
If that's the case, then why don't you prove it?

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.920
P-Prove it? But...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:47.430
Oh? Do you not have confidence?

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.890
That's not true!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.910
Fine! I'll prove I'm not lying!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.660
Now, confirm it for yourself!

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.450
Right away, then...

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:58.960
Wh-What are you...?

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.170
Huh?

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:04.720
No!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.160
Wh-What is this?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.180
What did you do?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.860
Nothing.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:18.560
I just gave you a little bit of a succubus's
 baptism and put you in a state of arousal.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.800
Now, Basara-san,

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:20.800
Huh?

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:25.460
please confirm whether Kurumi-san
 really is more mature than Yuuki-san.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:30.030
Right now Kurumi-san is just as aroused as Yuuki-san gets

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.930
when the Master-Servant pact's curse activates.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:35.400
N-No way...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.810
If it's the same as Yuuki,

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:40.500
then I have to make her submit, too?

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:41.730
Yes.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:45.820
However, please let Yuuki-san join in.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:51.010
I'm sure she can't abide having her little sister claim she's more mature, right?

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.050
Of course not.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.460
You're cheeky for a little sister.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.520
I'll show you which of us is more mature.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.610
Eh? Onee?

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.660
No, you can't! No!

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:09.900
No!

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.430
It's all right, Kurumi.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.960
We'll relieve you soon.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.600
Big brother, Basara.....

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:26.800
Kurumi, put both your hands together above your head.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.590
Like this.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.590
Sis.... That place, don't........!

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.600
What a cute armpit.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:45.930
Armpit.

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.230
I see.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.200
Yuki... Help me to hold her hands in place.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.200
Ah.... I got it.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:03.300
Kurumi.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.000
I'm starting, Kurumi.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.600
Big brother, Basara!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.300
Do it.

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.600
Big brother, Basara! not there again.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.580
Hey, Maria?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:46.010
Why did you make Kurumi go that far when we haven't

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.860
forged a Master-Servant pact?

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.200
I'm sorry.

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:53.840
I thought it would be better for Kurumi-san to learn

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:56.710
what the Master-Servant pact you all share was like.

00:21:57.590 --> 00:22:00.790
But that doesn't mean you needed to play the villain on your own.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:06.730
I have an older sister, too.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.730
My strict older sister

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:13.180
probably won't forgive the actions I took during the incident with Zolgia.

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:19.370
So, at the very least, I wanted Yuuki-san and Kurumi-san to remain friendly sisters.

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:24.030
Just kidding, it was a joke.

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:25.900
Maria.

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:30.230
Basara-san, you're a lolicon, aren't you?

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:31.220
Not really.

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:34.220
I just cherish you.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:37.580
Jeez...

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:51.970
<i>Somewhere here, there's an enemy after me.</i>

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:58.070
<i>A fearsome one that holds the power to manipulate other people.</i>

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:01.750
<i>Who on Earth...?</i>

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:05.780
Watch out for Hasegawa-sensei.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:12.940
<i>No, it doesn't matter who I'm up against.</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:16.090
<i>They're all my precious family.</i>

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:23.480
<i>I'll protect them for sure!</i>

00:25:14.340 --> 00:25:17.510
We got swept awfully far away.

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:23.760
There, there. You're a fortunate one.

00:25:25.360 --> 00:25:26.750
Now then...
